abstract: >-
  LSC 6.5.0 is the executable, audited, and reproducible exact finite-dilation
  successor in the established LSC model lineage. It uses one frozen universal
  alpha_0. The historical 6.3.0 identity is preserved; 6.3.1 was abandoned
  before release, and the 6.4.0 linear development attempt remains an adverse
  result. Phase 1 is complete. Development was retrospective and non-blind;
  experimental Phase 2 validation has not begun, and BEST-2 remains future-blind.
